.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Provision and maintain Kubernetes High-Availability clusters with ease


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-c\fP, \fB--credentials\fP=""
	File to source credentials and secrets from

.PP
\fB-d\fP, \fB--debug\fP[=false]
	debug output with stacktrace

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
